        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rhine Defense Section Employee",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rhine Defense Section Employee",
        "text": "...It's me."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rhine Defense Section Employee",
        "text": "You were right. The cop chose to help the Pioneers. And Elena Urbica turned on Director Clooney."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "A sigh leaks out of the communicator."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Parvis",
        "text": "What a shame."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Parvis",
        "text": "Ferdinand has lost."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_528_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rhine Defense Section Employee",
        "text": "Why do you say that? Sure, I couldn't stop them, but there aren't too many."
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Parvis",
        "text": "I just happened to see your old boss returning to Rhine Lab headquarters."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_528_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rhine Defense Section Employee",
        "text": "Director Saria?!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rhine Defense Section Employee",
        "text": "Gah..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Parvis",
        "text": "Settle down. You've taken quite a beating, yes? From whom? The cop? I believe you said she's like Saria in some ways?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_528_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rhine Defense Section Employee",
        "text": "There's nobody quite like her."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rhine Defense Section Employee",
        "text": "I... I just don't understand."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rhine Defense Section Employee",
        "text": "Why would she do that? All the hard work she put in... Rhine Lab meant more to her than health or fame."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rhine Defense Section Employee",
        "text": "I wanted to follow in her footsteps and defend Rhine. Why would she betray us?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Parvis",
        "text": "Did she...? Or did we let her down?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_528_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rhine Defense Section Employee",
        "text": "What do you\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Parvis",
        "text": "Ah, the follies of youth."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Parvis",
        "text": "The young seek out those they think are of like mind, but true understanding only comes with time."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Parvis",
        "text": "They may argue incessantly now, but there was a time when they treated each other with sincerity, more or less."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_528_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rhine Defense Section Employee",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rhine Defense Section Employee",
        "text": "Director Parvis... do I hear music?"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "blocker",
        "params": {
            "a": 0,
            "r": 0,
            "g": 0,
            "b": 0,
